          "title": "毒枭潜艇",
          "content": "<p>哥伦比亚贩毒集团使用潜艇，向国外运送毒品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010601.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010602.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这些“潜艇”实际上并没有完全潜入水中，在水面上露出很少一截，但是难以被发现。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010603.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010604.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>最惊人的是，这些潜艇是贩毒集团在哥伦比亚丛林工厂里面，自己建造的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010605.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010606.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这些工厂能够建造远洋航行的潜艇，规模肯定小不了，可见贩毒集团有多庞大。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010607.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202301/bg2023010608.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
